" Priority cookies: [#A] → [#B] → [#C] → none.

Given org (forward cycle, placed after the keyword):
  * TODO Task :tag:

Execute:
  call org#priority#cycle()
  AssertEqual '* TODO [#A] Task :tag:', getline(1)
  call org#priority#cycle()
  AssertEqual '* TODO [#B] Task :tag:', getline(1)
  call org#priority#cycle()
  call org#priority#cycle()
  AssertEqual '* TODO Task :tag:', getline(1)

Given org (backward from none goes to [#C]; works from the body):
  ** Task
  body

Execute:
  2
  call org#priority#cycle_back()

Expect org:
  ** [#C] Task
  body

Given org (an unknown priority restarts the cycle):
  * NEXT [#E] Task

Execute:
  call org#priority#cycle()

Expect org:
  * NEXT [#A] Task
